# CMSTP App Paths Registry Key Modification | T1218.003 | https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/master/rules/windows/registry/registry_event/registry_event_cmstp_execution_by_registry.yml
source="WinEventLog:Microsoft-Windows-Sysmon/Operational" (EventCode IN (12, 13, 14)) TargetObject="*SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\App Paths\\cmmgr32.exe\\*" NOT ((TargetObject="*SOFTWARE\\Microsoft\\Windows\\CurrentVersion\\App Paths\\cmmgr32.exe\\CmstpExtensionDll" (Details IN ("C:\\Windows\\System32\\cmcfg32.dll", "C:\\Windows\\SysWOW64\\cmcfg32.dll"))) OR Details="(Empty)")
